High experience levels are mainly for spellcasters. A wizard needs the slots
to improve in all those spell schools, but even more importantly, the "spell
damage" value varies with XL. Since there's not much of a downside to XL30 vs.
XL14 (contrary to an until recently widespread myth), you can make your magic
missile / cone of cold / fireball spells the most dangerous weapons in the
game.

No use bothering to get a combat wombat past XL14 as far as I can see, though.

